    "Las preguntas complejas se procesan con Claude (Anthropic). Enviamos tu pregunta + un resumen de tus datos (montos, categorías, fechas). Nunca emails, ni tarjetas, ni contraseñas." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Complex questions are processed with Claude (Anthropic). We send your question + a summary of your data (amounts, categories, dates). Never emails, cards, or passwords."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
